      "type": "use-cases",
      "visible": true,
      "toc": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Adonia's Trifusion Stormweaver 等配置把它放在副手组，产生 Infusion 并获得充能，然后切回主伤害组。"
      ],
      "bullets": []
    },
    {
      "id": "alternatives",
